fits Flow, while complex transaction logic and high-volume processing may require Apex."}],["$","p","Lightning Web Components provide task-focused experiences when standard pages are insufficient. Components should remain small, reusable and accessible.",{"children":"Lightning Web Components provide task-focused experiences when standard pages are insufficient. Components should remain small, reusable and accessible."}],["$","p","Governor limits, bulk behavior and the sharing model belong in every design decision. Apex tests should protect business behavior rather than merely reach a coverage number.",{"children":"Governor limits, bulk behavior and the sharing model belong in every design decision. Apex tests should protect business behavior rather than merely reach a coverage number."}],["$","p","A sound architecture separates the responsibilities of Flow, Apex and LWC, reducing technical debt and making future releases safer.",{"children":"A sound architecture separates the responsibilities of Flow, Apex and LWC, reducing technical debt and making future releases safer."}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"contact page-contact","children":["$","footer",null,{"className":"shell","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"brand","href":"/","aria-label":"Ana sayfaya dön","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/logo.svg","alt":"Samet ER — Salesforce Developer"}]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["© 2026 Samet ER. Bursa, ","Türkiye","."]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/samet-er-75915a3a3/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"LinkedIn"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://github.com/sametre","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"GitHub"}]]}]]}]}]]}]
